DATA NOTICE

This repository contains SOURCE CODE ONLY. It does not contain, and does not
grant any right to, the HBN-EEG dataset or any derivative of it.

The HBN-EEG data are distributed by the Child Mind Institute Healthy Brain
Network (HBN) program under a Data Use Agreement. Anyone wishing to obtain the
data must apply through the HBN portal and accept the HBN DUA terms:

    https://www.hbnconsortium.org/

Derived data products (per-subject network features, model fit statistics, and
clinical-association tables) are also restricted, because they contain
de-identified but non-public participant-level information subject to the same
DUA. They are therefore NOT redistributed here. The analysis scripts in this
repository regenerate all of them from the raw HBN-EEG recordings.
